msgid "How to hide USB controllers from dom0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/usb-qubes.rst:179
#: 6a564b730c334627bbe5eba21415b826
msgid ""
"USB controllers are automatically hidden from dom0 if you opt to create a "
"USB qube during installation. This also occurs automatically if you choose "
"to :ref:`create a USB qube <user/advanced-topics/usb-qubes:how to create a "
"usb qube>` using the ``qubesctl`` method. However, if you create a USB qube "
"manually and do not hide USB controllers from dom0, there will be a brief "
"period of time during the boot process when dom0 will be exposed to your USB "
"controllers (and any attached devices). This is a potential security risk, "
"since even brief exposure to a malicious USB device could result in dom0 "
"being compromised. There are two approaches to this problem:"
msgstr ""

